<title>USA: U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soymeal export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 217,700 MT improved 50 percent from the previous  week and were two and one-third times the 4-week average.</p>
<p>The major increases were for unknown destinations (78,500 MT), China (50,000 MT), Ireland (24,000 MT), Canada (17,500 MT), and Colombia (14,100 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 93,700 MT were off 46 percent from the previous week's marketing-year high and one-quarter from the 4-week average. Turkey (25,000 MT), Australia (20,000 MT), Canada (14,800 MT), and Guatemala (9,300 MT) were the major recipients.</p>
</text>
